B.a7R=new A.c8(B.lW,["future-urban-mobility","The Future of Urban Mobility in Kenya","Technology","5 min read","assets/images/future-urban-mobility.jpg","How Cabi is transforming the way Nairobi moves with decentralized ride-hailing, electric bodas, and fair driver revenue sharing.","Fees charged are not for corporate enrichment, but are actively recycled into driver wealth creation and vehicle asset equity.","Cabi Operations Team"],t.li)
B.a7S=new A.c8(B.lW,["the-road-to-dignity-why-drivers-choose-cabi","The Road to Dignity: Why Drivers Choose Cabi","Community","3 min read","assets/images/driver-economic-growth.jpg","A candid look at how reusable commissions and driver wealth creation turn daily miles into real asset ownership and long-term security.",'"For the first time in five years of driving, I am not just surviving day-to-day. My daily trips now contribute automatically to my driver wealth fund." \u2014 Samuel M., Driver Partner',"Cabi Editorial Desk"],t.li)
