B.a7Q=new A.c8(B.lW,["the-power-of-warmth-courtesy-and-tipping","The Power of Warmth: Courtesy and Tipping","Community & Culture","3 min read","assets/images/kindness-courtesy-tipping.jpg","A vehicle or boda is a shared human sanctuary. How a kind greeting, patience in traffic, and 100% direct driver tips create solidarity across our cities.","100% of every tip goes directly to the driver with 0% platform deductions. Every shilling settles immediately into their mobile money wallet.","Grace W., Community Lead"],t.li)
